          "overview": "When small-time online scammer Soufian is forced to take a job at the Super XL supermarket to pay off his debts, he uncovers a plan to replace the staff with automated self-checkout systems. What starts as a quick-money scheme turns into an unexpected rebellion, as the store’s eccentric shelf stackers refuse to be made obsolete.",
